  charType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c0929d5203a972646bd8aafa1fdcd9e5, type: 2}
  lineTexts:
  - It really is you, the one they brought here!
  - Is what the raccoon said true? That you can't remember anything?
  - I saw how you got here, I am watching over the forest which is currently quite
    a challenge because I still have to collect and stock a lot of supplies for the
    winter!
  - Would  you mind bringing me some specific mushrooms? The Racoon that you are
    an expert in finding those?
